<title>USA: Renaissance Hotel declines comment on shrs.</title>
<headline>Renaissance Hotel declines comment on shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday that Renaissance Hotel Group declined to comment about the increase in the company's stock.</p>
<p>Renaissance Hotel shares gained 2-3/4 to close at 16-3/8 on 876,100 shares of volume.</p>
<p>The exchange said it had contacted the company and request that the company issue a public statement about any corporate developments which may explain the unusual activity.</p>
